        <mxCell id="lifecycle" value="EXPERIMENT-LIFECYCLE (F12-K Domaenenmodell v3 §4.1)&#xa;━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━&#xa;1. PLATFORM-PROBE  (CPU-Features, ISA, Cache-Topo, Memory-Topo, verfuegbare Original-Compiler?)&#xa;2. MODE-DETECTION  (COMPILE_TIME XOR RUNTIME — gegenseitig ausschliessend, F9)&#xa;3. MODULE-PERMUTATIONS-SCAN  (welche pre-built? Liste vorhandener perm_ids)&#xa;4. ADHOC BUILD  (falls fehlend: Python-Codegen → CMake → Original-Compiler je Baustein → static link → .so)&#xa;5. PRO MODUL EXPERIMENT-LOOP:&#xa;   reset() → load() → Cache-Warmup (modul-spezifisch!) → Dataset-Prep → Experiment&#xa;   → on_observation() Push (DecisionTrees: EXECUTE/DELAY/SKIP) → spool() → unload()&#xa;6. SERIALISIERUNG  (InMemoryBuffer → Disk-Dump Binary/CSV)&#xa;7. LATEX-RENDERER  (Anhang fuer Diplomarbeit: tabular + pgfplots + booktabs + siunitx)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#424242;strokeWidth=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#000000;spacingTop=8;spacingLeft=12;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="880" width="1440" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>

